  "title": "Cuban Beans and Rice",
  "description": "This Cuban beans and rice recipe is made of kidney beans simmered with onion, bell pepper, garlic, tomato paste, and rice. It’s a very filling dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Chris Barila"
  ],
